  "description": "The device's speakers and microphone for a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge web app, backed by Shiny.Audio — play clips from a URL or a file root, read and set the system volume, record the microphone to WAV with effect presets, list audio routes, and route the microphone live to the output, with level meters as events. One call: bridge.AddAudioBridge().",
